                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Barrow Legion^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+:
• If the target is damaged, **Heal (3)** the target.
• If the target is not damaged, return a number of slain models to it with a combined Health characteristic of up to 3.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
